WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.975
c moves the line up or down, and the steepness stays the same.

2
00:00:04.954 --> 00:00:09.854
The dashed line is y equals two x plus one; the solid starts the same.

3
00:00:10.609 --> 00:00:14.259
A bigger c moves the line up, and it stays just as steep.

4
00:00:16.763 --> 00:00:21.088
With c equal to four, the line crosses the y axis at four.

5
00:00:21.843 --> 00:00:25.518
It has the same m, so it is parallel to the dashed line.

6
00:00:26.171 --> 00:00:31.121
A negative c moves it down: c of negative two crosses at negative two.
